eo/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521770/extras/a09db72b6df907453420863c1df61623.avif?t=1748769270\" data-has-big width=800 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The replayability is infinite. Wanna spice things up? Play on random maps with random characters every round, or change the settings to make it super mega fun for you and your friends. For each mode numerous game settings are available! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You have an idea for the characters? Join my discord and I might add your character to the game!</i></p>",
